.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Julian E Barnes</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128728168,imgsize-103574.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Husband overstayed H‑1B visa for 20 years': DHS responds to UK grandmother’s six-week ICE detention]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128724976.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/husband-overstayed-h1b-visa-for-20-years-dhs-responds-to-uk-grandmothers-six-week-ice-detention/articleshow/128724976.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/husband-overstayed-h1b-visa-for-20-years-dhs-responds-to-uk-grandmothers-six-week-ice-detention/articleshow/128724976.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-24T00:04:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128724976,imgsize-865333.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Could you just be normal': Canada leader slammed for her specific concern for LGBTQ tourists in Mexico after El Mencho's killing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128726051.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/could-you-just-be-normal-canada-leader-slammed-for-her-specific-concern-for-lgbtq-tourists-in-mexico-after-el-menchos-killing/articleshow/128726051.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/could-you-just-be-normal-canada-leader-slammed-for-her-specific-concern-for-lgbtq-tourists-in-mexico-after-el-menchos-killing/articleshow/128726051.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-23T23:54:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org