 urging readers to explore this critical shift in global markets.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/the-2028-global-intelligence-crisis-who-is-author-alap-shah/articleshow/128722260.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/the-2028-global-intelligence-crisis-who-is-author-alap-shah/articleshow/128722260.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-23T22:50:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128723709,imgsize-25224.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['This is not correct': Kash Patel slams Carol Leonnig, Ken Dilanian over party with US hockey Olympics team; author hits back]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128718483.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[FBI Director Kash Patel has refuted claims by journalists Carol Leonnig and Ken Dilanian that his trip to Milan was solely for personal enjoyment at the Olympics. Patel's spokesperson clarified the visit involved crucial security meetings and partner engagements, with any personal time being self-funded.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-not-correct-kash-patel-slams-carol-leonnig-ken-dilanian-over-party-with-us-hockey-olympics-team-author-hits-back/articleshow/128718483.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-not-correct-kash-patel-slams-carol-leonnig-ken-dilanian-over-party-with-us-hockey-olympics-team-author-hits-back/articleshow/128718483.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-23T21:24:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128721020,imgsize-28532.cms"/></item><it